dct_description_sm:
Replication data for the article "Linking detrital minerals to their source: The use of U-Pb-Hf data to untangle Laurentian and Gondwanan (Ganderian) sources", contains two files, one table (S1) and one text document (D1).

Table S1 is a Supplementary Data Table that includes several excel tabs as follow:

a) Sample locations;
b) Detrital zircon laser ablation split stream U-Pb and Hf isotopic data with concordia plots for unknowns;
c–d) Laser ablation split stream U-Pb (c) and Hf (d) data for secondary reference materials;
e) Hf–Yb correlation plots for split-stream data;
f) LA-ICP-MS U-Pb data for magmatic samples with concordia plots;
g) Hf isotopic data for magmatic samples;
h–i) Secondary reference materials for U-Pb (h) and Hf (i) from magmatic sample sessions;
j) Maximum depositional age calculations (weighted mean and minimum age radial plots) for detrital samples when applicable;
k) Magmatic crystallization ages (weighted mean) for Miramichi samples.

Document D1 presents the detailed analytical method used to acquire all the data presented in the article.
